{"id":"n38524-1-11","stage":0,"title":"낫다 · 更好","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38524-1-11-1","ko":"승규하고 민준이 중에 누가 컴퓨터를 더 잘하니?","zh":"承奎和敏俊，谁更擅长用电脑？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규하고","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；하고：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"승규하고","audio":"/audio/0903d747344605b14552.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규하고","audio":"/audio/0903d747344605b14552.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：人名“敏俊”；-이 接在辅音结尾的人名后，带亲近口吻，这里与前面的 승규 并列比较。","readings":[{"term":"민준이","audio":"/audio/32f61c157245f6426f6e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이","audio":"/audio/32f61c157245f6426f6e.mp3"}},{"text":"중에","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에","audio":"/audio/f0d257645978930f07ec.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누가 是 누구＋-가，用来询问承奎和敏俊两人中是哪一位。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"컴퓨터를","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터를","audio":"/audio/bfcc5ca23ddba7ce1fc4.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘하니?","meaning":"更擅长","explanation":"잘하다：做得好、擅长；컴퓨터를 잘하다 在这里是“擅长使用电脑”；-니 是非敬语疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘하니","audio":"/audio/62e056ff4d79787e480e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"用于询问某人是谁；本句问两人中的哪一位。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/853b3ffccbac1755cdc5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38524-1-11-2","ko":"승규가 훨씬 나아요.","zh":"承奎比他强多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"훨씬","meaning":"更加，远远地","explanation":"훨씬：更加，远远地。","readings":[{"term":"훨씬","audio":"/audio/b364daea4cbc5e721b5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73250","senseId":"1","lemma":"훨씬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"훨씬","audio":"/audio/b364daea4cbc5e721b5e.mp3"}},{"text":"나아요.","meaning":"更好、强","explanation":"낫다：比较之下更好；与 훨씬 连用表示“强多了”。","readings":[{"term":"낫다","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38524","senseId":"1","lemma":"낫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나아요","audio":"/audio/f8706efb50a075f4e20b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b364daea4cbc5e72","term":"훨씬","zh":"更加，远远地","audio":"/audio/b364daea4cbc5e721b5e.mp3","entryId":"73250","definition":"与某物相比差别很大地。","pronunciation":["훨씬"]},{"id":"fde5eb6648ee9db9","term":"낫다","zh":"更好，胜过","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3","entryId":"38524","definition":"相比之下，比别的好。","pronunciation":["낟ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/84092b00a87880c0fde4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38524","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":19,"sequenceScore":0.7402,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["承奎和敏俊，谁更擅长用电脑？","承奎比他强多了。","您是来修理吉他的吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎和敏俊，谁更擅长用电脑？","承奎比他强多了。","您是来修理吉他的吗？"],"answer":1}]}
